00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:51.040 line:100%
QIHUANG CLINIC

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:58.200 line:100%
SIZHUKONG, ERMEN

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.400 line:100%
That person also told me
that in the afternoon of June 30th,

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.720 line:100%
those two people would head
to Qihuang Clinic.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.840 line:100%
He told me to wait for them there.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:28.080 line:100%
-A clinic?
-An unlicensed <i>qigong</i> center.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.240 line:100%
It's probably sealed.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.040 line:100%
What about the photo?

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:33.080 line:100%
I burned it.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.880 line:100%
It's a rule in the gang.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.520 line:100%
What does "make them disappear" mean?

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.960 line:100%
Kill them?

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.640 line:100%
I don't know either.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:45.640 line:100%
He picked up the phone call and vanished.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.520 line:100%
Officer He.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.800 line:100%
I never intended to kill anyone.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.800 line:100%
<i>I just wanted to scare them,</i>

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.880 line:100%
<i>so they would leave Weiyang</i>
<i>and never come back again.</i>

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.400 line:100%
<i>That's disappearing, isn't it?</i>

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:02.000 line:100%
<i>I waited and waited, but no one ever came.</i>

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.840 line:100%
<i>So, I went out to take a peek.</i>

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.120 line:100%
<i>Then, I heard screams on the floor above.</i>

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.120 line:100%
<i>I then realized that the woman</i>
<i>and the old man</i>

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.880 line:100%
<i>didn't head to the 17th floor,</i>

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.120 line:100%
<i>but the 18th floor.</i>

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.400 line:100%
I went to Pattia before.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.160 line:100%
I know there is a secret door there.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:22.480 line:100%
I figured they might
be hiding on the rooftop.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.960 line:100%
But I walked around and didn't see them.

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:26.400 line:100%
Who gave you the keys?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.400 line:100%
I used some tricks.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.600 line:100%
<i>Then, I wanted to get out of there.</i>

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.840 line:100%
<i>Then you people came to the 18th floor,</i>

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.440 line:100%
<i>group by group.</i>

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.640 line:100%
<i>I couldn't run away.</i>

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:48.880 line:100%
<i>I waited until the sun set.</i>

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.640 line:100%
<i>I couldn't stand it anymore.</i>

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.280 line:100%
<i>So, I let it out.</i>

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:57.960 line:100%
<i>I was all sweaty and dirty,</i>

00:03:58.560 --> 00:03:59.840 line:100%
<i>and I thought</i>

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.280 line:100%
<i>I couldn't just suffer this for nothing.</i>

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.920 line:100%
<i>I must get the balance of the payment.</i>

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.680 line:100%
<i>I must show the gang how good I am.</i>

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.199 line:100%
<i>So, I bluffed.</i>

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.560 line:100%
<i>I grabbed a bag,</i>
<i>made myself a bloody cloak,</i>

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.440 line:100%
<i>and told everyone</i>
<i>that I had killed two people.</i>

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.520 line:100%
Then, the blood in the bag…

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:31.680 line:100%
It's all chicken blood.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:33.680 line:100%
Test it if you don't trust me.

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:36.280 line:100%
If it's human blood,
just shoot me on the spot.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.360 line:100%
What were you doing in 407?

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.960 line:100%
Who gave you the job?

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.200 line:100%
I don't know who he is.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:00.240 line:100%
-How much did he offer?
-Forty-thousand yuan.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.520 line:100%
But he still owes me
the balance of 30,000 yuan.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.400 line:100%
You can't even recognize him.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.320 line:100%
How are you supposed to ask him to pay?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.720 line:100%
He said he'd call me after the job.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:10.680 line:100%
Buddy.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.000 line:100%
You killed them.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.000 line:100%
Why would he contact you?

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.400 line:100%
So that you can turn yourself in
to the police?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.520 line:100%
Gosh.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.000 line:100%
Did anyone see you when you did it?

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.400 line:100%
Answer me!

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:33.560 line:100%
I think

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.880 line:100%
I saw someone when I was leaving.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.040 line:100%
You think?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:58.720 line:100%
Idiot! And you can sleep
at night like this?

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:01.400 line:100%
Find that witness and silence him.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:05.040 line:100%
That old man in 407 saw me.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:07.000 line:100%
I had to silence him.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.800 line:100%
Someone still owes me 30,000 yuan.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:12.080 line:100%
If someone tells the police,

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.960 line:100%
I will be busted.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.760 line:100%
I was very polite to him.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.920 line:100%
Yes.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.360 line:100%
He was quite polite.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:23.760 line:100%
But really, I've never seen him before.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.920 line:100%
Never.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.840 line:100%
Last night,

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.240 line:100%
I was reading a detective novel in my bed.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.800 line:100%
I was captivated by it, and it kept me up.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:34.880 line:100%
I couldn't sleep,

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.120 line:100%
so I thought I could climb some stairs

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.280 line:100%
and sweat a little before I went to bed.

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.040 line:100%
As soon as I opened
the door to the staircase,

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.240 line:100%
I felt so drowsy.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.200 line:100%
My eyelids were heavy.
I could barely keep them open.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:50.680 line:100%
So, I went back to sleep.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.600 line:100%
I didn't see anything.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:54.960 line:100%
I didn't see him.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.040 line:100%
You love to read detective novels?

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.040 line:100%
Yes.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.000 line:100%
You too?

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.040 line:100%
Yes.

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:04.480 line:100%
We have the same hobby.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.320 line:100%
What kind of detective novels?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.640 line:100%
The classical European ones or--

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.160 line:100%
Du Mandun.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.680 line:100%
If you didn't see Jin Manlang,
why did you call the police?

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:16.200 line:100%
I'm a fan of mysteries.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.160 line:100%
Did you notice?

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:22.040 line:100%
Yesterday, someone disappeared
in a locked room on the 18th floor.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.520 line:100%
Today, everyone is singing
that nursery song.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:30.080 line:100%
Isn't that just like the prelude
to a murder in every detective novel?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.640 line:100%
Speak plainly, please.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.480 line:100%
Continue. I understand everything.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.400 line:100%
-Okay. Listen.
-Sure.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:40.040 line:100%
I thought the whole thing
could never be this simple.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.200 line:100%
-At first…
-You didn't even see a shadow.

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.640 line:100%
Who says I didn't see anything?

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:46.320 line:100%
I saw her clearly.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.200 line:100%
I saw the woman twice.

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.920 line:100%
I saw her carrying… Like…

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.840 line:100%
Relax. Tell us one by one.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.200 line:100%
<i>I first saw her</i>

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:02.760 line:100%
<i>in the morning several days ago.</i>

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:06.800 line:100%
<i>Right at the corner of the staircase.</i>

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:21.200 line:100%
The second time I saw her was yesterday.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:26.320 line:100%
I was playing gateball
at the park with Meng and Wang.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.880 line:100%
I saw the woman walking by
while carrying an old man.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.760 line:100%
She looked exactly like the woman

00:08:31.839 --> 00:08:34.640 line:100%
I had met on the staircase
several days ago.

00:08:34.719 --> 00:08:36.160 line:100%
Are you sure they were identical?

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.400 line:100%
Try to recall.

00:08:40.479 --> 00:08:42.760 line:100%
Did anything stand out
when you saw the woman?

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.040 line:100%
-Anything that stood out?
-Yes.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.200 line:100%
She had medical patches on her wrists.

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.360 line:100%
Over here and over here.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:09.680 line:100%
These are probably marks
left by medical patches.

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:14.360 line:100%
It matches.

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.640 line:100%
How so?

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.120 line:100%
The medical patch has her name on it?

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.080 line:100%
This is an important lead.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.240 line:100%
What kind of woman would use
medical patches on her wrists?

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.160 line:100%
It must have something to do with her job.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.760 line:100%
That's just your opinion.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:30.640 line:100%
I think she might have injured
her wrists while she carried things.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.720 line:100%
Or she might have a scar
that she didn't want anyone to see.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.120 line:100%
The possibilities are endless.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.200 line:100%
Yes. You're absolutely right.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.680 line:100%
All these possibilities
are possible clues to this murder.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.680 line:100%
Must you get us a murder case?

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.400 line:100%
Someone has hired a man to kill them.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:43.960 line:100%
How is this not a murder?

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.320 line:100%
Officer, is this truly a murder?

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.720 line:100%
We analyzed the blood
in the bag and on the rooftop.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:07.840 line:100%
It's not human blood.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:11.240 line:100%
The saliva sample from the cigarette butt
matches Jin Manlang.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.480 line:100%
It seems like someone
has tried so hard for nothing.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:21.080 line:100%
They probably hope the witnesses are lying
so that they can continue investigating.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.160 line:100%
I know they are not lying.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.240 line:100%
How do you know?

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:27.200 line:100%
Eyes are the window to your soul.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.160 line:100%
If you look to the left when you speak,
it means that you're recalling.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.760 line:100%
If you look to the right,
it means you're making things up.

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:32.920 line:100%
When Jin Manlang and Mr. Du were speaking,

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.480 line:100%
they were looking to the left.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.280 line:100%
What about the photo?

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:39.560 line:100%
<i>I burned it.</i>

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.760 line:100%
I first saw her

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.440 line:100%
in the…

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.480 line:100%
They did not have
the telltale sign of lying.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.320 line:100%
Smarty pants who like to lecture.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.920 line:100%
They did not lie,

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.880 line:100%
but that doesn't mean
the two missing people

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.280 line:100%
are not in danger.

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:07.800 line:100%
Can you two stop arguing?

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:10.880 line:100%
I analyzed everything in the box.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.000 line:100%
Nothing new.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.680 line:100%
Keep it or return it, it's your call.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:17.120 line:100%
I still have work to do.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.320 line:100%
<i>THE GREEK COFFIN MYSTERY</i>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.840 line:100%
MISSING PERSON

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:05.800 line:100%
MISSING PERSON

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:09.000 line:100%
Why is this poster still here?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.200 line:100%
Isn't it weird?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.320 line:100%
Let me show you something weirder.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:27.880 line:100%
DEMOLITION

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.320 line:100%
Does this look familiar to you?

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.680 line:100%
Does this belong to Jin Manlang?

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:54.560 line:100%
I returned everything back then.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.560 line:100%
This mooncake box belongs to Wolfie.

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:01.400 line:20%
This detective novel belongs to Du Mandun.

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:07.040 line:100%
Why are their things
kept together in the same place?

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.400 line:100%
And look at the poster.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:13.720 line:20%
The paper and the ink are both new.

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.200 line:100%
Weird, isn't it?

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:19.040 line:100%
It has been so many years.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.400 line:100%
I never believed
that Yuanlongli was haunted.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:24.960 line:100%
YUXI CIGARETTE

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:27.000 line:100%
Someone must be behind all of this.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.840 line:100%
407.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.920 line:100%
Du Mandun's unit.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:04.800 line:100%
He moved out several months ago.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:30.640 line:100%
So, it was all a false alarm.

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:37.880 line:100%
Du Mandun moved out,
but he didn't take his books.

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:50.240 line:100%
I remember he was quite invested

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.200 line:100%
in the missing persons case back then.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.640 line:100%
He even discussed some conspiracies
or locked rooms with you.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.560 line:100%
Sir,

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:58.120 line:100%
ever since we set foot into Yuanlongli,

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.200 line:100%
you've been mentioning
that particular case.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:02.080 line:100%
What does it have to do
with the missing kid?

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.200 line:100%
It has everything to do with it.
They are both missing person cases.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.200 line:100%
So?

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.360 line:100%
So, we're looking for them.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:11.720 line:100%
Sir,

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.240 line:100%
I came to Weiyang
to write the lesson plan,

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:14.760 line:100%
and my schedule is tight enough.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.640 line:100%
Three floors left.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:20.240 line:100%
You gave me your word.

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:22.400 line:100%
Now keep your promise.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.200 line:100%
Let's go.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:35.880 line:100%
Let's go.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:48.160 line:20%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:01.400 line:100%
I already signed.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.680 line:100%
Please sign it, too.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.120 line:100%
CRIMINAL CASE REGISTRATION FORM

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:08.400 line:100%
Since you always go to Qu Dahai,
ask him to sign it.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.360 line:100%
He doesn't have the power.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:12.560 line:100%
Neither do I.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:15.240 line:100%
Don't worry. After you sign it,
I'll be in charge of it.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.600 line:100%
You're a rookie. How
can you be in charge of it?

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.800 line:100%
Our priority now is not to file a case.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:22.040 line:100%
It's to find those two people.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.120 line:100%
If you won't sign the registration form,

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.240 line:100%
can you sign this?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.160 line:20%
EVIDENCE SUBPOENA REQUEST FORM

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:37.000 line:100%
What is this?

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.520 line:100%
The woman used medical patches.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.440 line:100%
I want to check the hospital records

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.600 line:100%
to see if someone
injured their wrists lately.

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.320 line:100%
You don't have
any real-life experience, do you?

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.480 line:100%
Do you think

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.040 line:100%
they will go to the hospital
for a small injury like this?

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:54.400 line:100%
Where else could she
have gotten the patches?

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:55.680 line:100%
In a pharmacy.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.920 line:100%
In a clinic.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:59.240 line:100%
Many people are selling
common medications.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.240 line:100%
Following your method, I can sign it,

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:03.840 line:100%
and you still won't
find anything after years.

00:17:03.919 --> 00:17:05.119 line:100%
Then, how should we proceed?

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.520 line:100%
Put up posters and wait on the bench?

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:09.320 line:100%
Are you lecturing me right now?

00:17:09.399 --> 00:17:11.720 line:100%
At least I caught someone
after waiting the whole day.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.320 line:100%
What did you find?

00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:14.960 line:100%
Chicken blood?

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:17.280 line:100%
Duck blood can be added to a hotpot.
But chicken blood? It's useless.

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:18.600 line:100%
