00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.880 line:100%
<i>Your soon is getting absurdly long.</i>

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.560 line:100%
Kiddo,

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.400 line:100%
I recently ran into a troublemaker.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.560 line:100%
He keeps pestering me.

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.800 line:100%
<i>Then, buy me a bottle of Coke.</i>

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.840 line:100%
<i>Don't tell Mom.</i>

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.240 line:100%
Sure.

