<i>Wait. Mom wants to talk to you.</i>

00:17:58.200 --> 00:17:59.040 line:100%
<i>Xiaohe.</i>

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.080 line:100%
<i>Go back to your room.</i>

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.560 line:100%
<i>He Yuanhang, where are you?</i>

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:04.960 line:100%
I'm working now.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.520 line:100%
I need to work hard to impress my boss.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.560 line:100%
That way, I can stay
in the criminal department.

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.840 line:100%
<i>Are you trying to get back</i>
<i>to the police station again?</i>

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:14.880 line:100%
Who says that? That's impossible.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:16.600 line:100%
<i>I met Qu Dahai today.</i>

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:17.800 line:100%
<i>He told me that.</i>

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.400 line:100%
-<i>He said you'd return next week.</i>
-Qu Dahai.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.560 line:100%
Listen. He's trying to break us up.

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:26.520 line:100%
He can't wait to return
to the police station.

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:28.600 line:100%
<i>What? He Yuanhang!</i>

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:29.680 line:100%
It's noisy here.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:30.760 line:100%
The lines are mixed up.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:34.120 line:100%
-Officer He said only six days left till…
-Till I catch…

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.040 line:100%
Wait. It's noisy here.

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.800 line:100%
Only six days left till he goes back to…

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:39.760 line:100%
Give me a moment.

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:46.160 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:49.640 line:100%
I'll work hard to stay
