00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.600 line:100%
I have a meeting soon. Okay.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.200 line:100%
Getting bolder now, huh?

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:12.520 line:100%
Let's go.

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.280 line:100%
You go ahead. I need to work.

