00:34:17.959 --> 00:34:19.160 line:100%
Officer.

00:34:19.240 --> 00:34:21.999 line:100%
I just washed my feet. They are clean.

00:34:24.400 --> 00:34:25.680 line:100%
Ms. Zhao.

00:34:25.760 --> 00:34:28.560 line:100%
I spilled the feet water
on his face just now.

00:34:29.240 --> 00:34:30.400 line:100%
Is it funny?

00:34:31.560 --> 00:34:32.880 line:100%
Tell me.

00:34:32.959 --> 00:34:35.400 line:100%
When did all of you last see Mengmeng?

00:34:36.039 --> 00:34:37.360 line:100%
I don't know.

00:34:39.640 --> 00:34:42.240 line:100%
She stopped coming to work three days ago.

00:34:43.560 --> 00:34:44.680 line:100%
Why?

00:34:45.640 --> 00:34:47.400 line:100%
Did she run into trouble
on her last day here?

00:34:47.479 --> 00:34:48.439 line:100%
I don't know.

00:34:49.760 --> 00:34:51.280 line:100%
What could possibly happen here?

00:34:51.360 --> 00:34:53.959 line:100%
And how would I know
why she stopped coming to work?

00:34:54.840 --> 00:34:57.840 line:100%
Did she meet any clients
on her last day here?

00:34:59.800 --> 00:35:01.560 line:100%
I don't know.

00:35:01.640 --> 00:35:02.880 line:100%
No one picked her.

00:35:02.960 --> 00:35:04.880 line:100%
She didn't earn anything,
so she stopped coming.

00:35:04.960 --> 00:35:05.800 line:100%
You…

00:35:09.040 --> 00:35:10.640 line:100%
First, you said you didn't know.

00:35:10.720 --> 00:35:12.440 line:100%
Now, you said no one picked her.

00:35:12.520 --> 00:35:14.840 line:100%
So, do you know something or not?

00:35:15.520 --> 00:35:16.760 line:100%
Sir.

00:35:18.320 --> 00:35:20.000 line:100%
"I don't know" is my catchphrase.

00:35:20.720 --> 00:35:23.800 line:100%
Mengmeng and I are colleagues.

00:35:23.880 --> 00:35:24.920 line:100%
She's like my subordinate.

00:35:25.520 --> 00:35:29.200 line:100%
Why would she tell me about her troubles?

00:35:29.880 --> 00:35:30.760 line:100%
Ask them if you don't trust me.

00:35:30.840 --> 00:35:33.640 line:100%
Would you come to me
if you run into trouble?

00:35:37.320 --> 00:35:38.480 line:100%
See?

00:35:45.400 --> 00:35:46.400 line:100%
All right.

00:35:47.240 --> 00:35:49.520 line:100%
Surely, you must know
Mengmeng's real name.

00:35:51.560 --> 00:35:52.840 line:100%
Of course.

00:35:59.600 --> 00:36:01.080 line:100%
NRIC PHOTOCOPY

00:36:06.360 --> 00:36:09.080 line:20%
XU MENG

00:36:09.160 --> 00:36:15.080 line:100%
DAJIANCHANG NEIGHBORHOOD

00:36:17.400 --> 00:36:20.880 line:100%
Why didn't you tell the others
to raid the foot massage parlor?

00:36:21.680 --> 00:36:23.080 line:100%
You know nothing.

00:36:23.640 --> 00:36:26.040 line:100%
It's not the time to retrieve the net yet.

00:36:26.800 --> 00:36:29.280 line:100%
Let's wait till we find
Xu Meng and her father.

00:36:50.480 --> 00:36:51.520 line:100%
Stop searching.

00:36:52.280 --> 00:36:53.920 line:100%
It should be that unit.

00:36:57.680 --> 00:37:03.040 line:100%
DIE

00:37:25.520 --> 00:37:26.640 line:100%
A putrid stench.

00:37:32.080 --> 00:37:33.240 line:100%
Corpse?

00:37:35.120 --> 00:37:36.320 line:100%
Not sure.

00:37:44.360 --> 00:37:45.880 line:100%
It's locked from the inside.

00:37:45.960 --> 00:37:47.760 line:100%
I can't open it without the keys.

00:38:00.400 --> 00:38:02.040 line:100%
Don't just stand there.

00:38:02.120 --> 00:38:03.480 line:100%
Call for backup

00:38:04.080 --> 00:38:05.600 line:100%
and ask them to break the door.

00:38:11.960 --> 00:38:13.000 line:100%
Do you know how to do this?

00:38:13.600 --> 00:38:16.640 line:100%
We learned how to pick locks at school.

00:38:16.720 --> 00:38:18.800 line:100%
They sure taught you
many practical things.

00:38:25.520 --> 00:38:26.560 line:100%
Are you doing this on purpose?

00:38:31.200 --> 00:38:32.600 line:100%
Listen.

00:38:32.680 --> 00:38:35.360 line:100%
Once we get back, make sure we follow
the due process for breaking in.

00:38:41.880 --> 00:38:43.080 line:100%
FOR RENT

00:39:11.240 --> 00:39:14.200 line:100%
The meat is all rotten.

00:39:14.280 --> 00:39:15.360 line:100%
Look.

00:39:15.440 --> 00:39:16.880 line:100%
They didn't even put the food away.

00:39:16.960 --> 00:39:18.520 line:100%
Probably left in a hurry.

00:39:22.960 --> 00:39:24.120 line:100%
I only have one.

00:39:38.240 --> 00:39:39.560 line:100%
Poor thing.

00:39:52.440 --> 00:39:53.680 line:100%
Why did they break the wall?

00:39:55.280 --> 00:39:56.400 line:100%
Officer He.

00:39:58.280 --> 00:39:59.480 line:100%
Size 37.

00:40:05.040 --> 00:40:06.000 line:100%
DOUBLE FISH

00:40:07.680 --> 00:40:08.960 line:100%
Double Fish Heels.

00:40:10.720 --> 00:40:11.800 line:100%
Authenticity logo.

00:40:12.400 --> 00:40:13.760 line:100%
It's expensive to get the real ones.

00:40:31.720 --> 00:40:33.320 line:100%
Why did they break the wall?

00:40:34.960 --> 00:40:37.000 line:100%
To move the cupboard out?

00:40:46.680 --> 00:40:47.520 line:100%
So skinny.

00:40:48.480 --> 00:40:50.320 line:100%
No wonder Xu Meng
could carry her father on her back.

00:40:51.720 --> 00:40:52.800 line:100%
The father's teeth are quite unique.

00:40:59.680 --> 00:41:01.600 line:100%
PENICILLIN V TABLETS

00:41:02.720 --> 00:41:03.600 line:100%
That's odd.

00:41:03.680 --> 00:41:04.960 line:100%
What is?

00:41:06.920 --> 00:41:10.760 line:100%
I saw in the security footage
that her father was holding a cigarette.

00:41:10.840 --> 00:41:12.360 line:100%
It looks like a cigarette.

00:41:13.120 --> 00:41:14.400 line:100%
But he has a lung disease.

00:41:14.480 --> 00:41:15.720 line:100%
Why would he be smoking?

00:41:17.320 --> 00:41:19.320 line:100%
They have done weirder things.

00:41:19.400 --> 00:41:20.800 line:100%
Perhaps he thought it wasn't worth it.

00:41:20.880 --> 00:41:22.800 line:100%
Just smoke and drink however he wanted.

00:41:34.160 --> 00:41:35.440 line:100%
HOUSEHOLD REGISTER

00:41:35.520 --> 00:41:36.360 line:100%
HOUSEHOLD REGISTER, SAVINGS ACCOUNT

00:41:38.960 --> 00:41:41.280 line:100%
REGISTER OF PERMANENT RESIDENT, XU ZHIHONG

00:41:41.360 --> 00:41:42.880 line:100%
REGISTER OF PERMANENT RESIDENT, XU MENG

00:42:07.000 --> 00:42:08.520 line:100%
Bowls?

00:42:08.600 --> 00:42:10.680 line:100%
I've seen this brand in a mall in Beijing.

00:42:11.280 --> 00:42:14.040 line:100%
This dress is probably
more expensive than this flat.

00:42:15.640 --> 00:42:19.200 line:100%
It doesn't feel like something
Xu Meng would wear.

00:42:19.280 --> 00:42:20.560 line:100%
It doesn't match her style.

00:42:21.840 --> 00:42:23.720 line:100%
You sure know your fashion.

00:42:55.760 --> 00:42:56.880 line:100%
Police!